# the lists' copies (2026-10-26): COPY SOUND / PASTE SOUND (EDIT: a synth's onto a synth, a kit's onto a kit),
# COPY DRUM / PASTE DRUM (a kit's drum onto another key), COPY SCENE / PASTE SCENE and DUPLICATE SLOT (HOME), KEY FILTER
# and KIT FILTER (a kit's ENV list, on all four pages)
wait 300
projnew
# T2's sound onto T3 (its cutoff and name with it), undone: T3's own again (the new band's gospel, cutoff 100)
param 2 cut 20
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap EDIT
tap SEL
row COPY SOUND
tap SEL
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 3
listen
tap SEL
row PASTE SOUND
wait 200
said PASTE SOUND from T2
tap SEL
wait 50
expect par3.cut 20
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect par3.cut 100
# T1's kick onto its snare
param 1 d1.model 5
param 1 d1.decay 40
turn ALGO -2
expect trk 1
tapkey b0
tap SEL
row COPY DRUM
tap SEL
tapkey b1
tap SEL
row PASTE DRUM
wait 200
said PASTE DRUM from kick
tap SEL
wait 50
expect par1.d2.model 5
expect par1.d2.decay 40
# KEY FILTER and KIT FILTER on every ENV page of a kit
tap ENV
tap SEL
row KEY FILTER
turn ALGO -5
turn ALGO 1
expect par1.d2.ftype 1
row KIT FILTER
tap HOME
turn SELECT 3
tap SEL
row KEY FILTER
row KIT FILTER
tap HOME
# scene 1 copied, scene 2 (a copy, T2 on P3) gets scene 1 back
scenedef 1 1 1
scenedef 2 1 3
tap HOME
tapkey w0
wait 50
tap SEL
row COPY SCENE
tap SEL
tapkey w1
wait 50
expect scene 2
expect spat2.2 3
tap SEL
row PASTE SCENE
tap SEL
wait 50
expect spat2.2 1
expect spat1.2 1
# a song slot duplicated after itself
song 1:2 2:1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
expect songlen 2
tap SEL
row DUPLICATE SLOT
tap SEL
wait 50
expect songlen 3
expect slotsc1 1
expect slotsc2 1
expect slotsc3 2
